# AetherRV bus ACL (ARCHITECTURE.md §4.1). Every service runs as the same Unix user, so this contains bugs rather
# than attackers: a service (MQTT client id = its name) may only publish its own state, health and events.
pattern read aetherrv/v1/#
pattern write aetherrv/v1/state/%c/#
pattern write aetherrv/v1/svc/%c/#
pattern write aetherrv/v1/event/%c/#
pattern write aetherrv/v1/cmd/#
pattern write aetherrv/v1/reply/#
